<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal leaves key rates steady.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal leaves key rates steady.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it offered to inject  30 billion escudos of eight-day funds in a variable rate repurchase  pact, effective on Monday, and left official rates unchanged.</p>
<p>It said it left the absorption rate, used to drain funds from the  money market, steady at 5.40 percent and the emergency lending rate  unchanged at 7.70 percent.</p>
<p>Bids for the repo funds must be submitted by 1415 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
